config INTERCONNECT_MTK_EXTENSION
	tristate "MediaTek network-on-chip interconnect extension driver"
	depends on INTERCONNECT_MTK
	help
	  MediaTek's out-of-tree interconnect extension framework, used by the
	  multimedia QoS (mmqos) provider and by the multimedia consumers
	  (camera/ISP, display, codecs) to describe per-port bandwidth paths
	  with the "mtk-interconnect-cells" bindings.
